The '''Hierbería Company''' ({{Lang-bl|Compañía Hierbería}}), marketed as '''HIERBERÍA''' is a [[Balisca]]-based transnational {{W|cooperative federation|federation}} of {{W|workers cooperative}}s, and the world's largest producer and marketer of {{W|cannabis}}, {{W|hemp}} and related or derived products. It was founded in [[Yerba Buena]], [[Araucaria]] in 1882.  

The word ''hierbería'' means "herbalist shop" or "medicinal shop" in [[Baliscano]].  

